{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15213540","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15213540","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1521354001:0":{"text":"ふん、やはりホーリンなどこの程度。ちょっと小突いただけで、立ち上がれないとは。","source_cn":"哼，果然是呼临人，根本扛不住几下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99E913C09171E570","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1521354002:0":{"text":"人間の小僧、もう降参したらどうだ？","source_cn":"还不认输吗？人类小子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90696CB2E4A652BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521354003:0":{"text":"まだだ……！まだ負けてない……僕は……まだ戦える！","source_cn":"不……！我、我还没有输……我还能……再战！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61A5F70D43E357CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521354004:0":{"text":"まだやるのか？これ以上やれば、確実に死ぬぞ！","source_cn":"再战？再战你就必死无疑了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3162A8281BECCF9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521354005:0":{"text":"フルアさんのためにも……僕は絶対に……負けるわけにはいかない！","source_cn":"为了芙……我不可能……不可能输！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x888BD32FE1E23723","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521354006:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……<key:dialog112>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8269301135897598","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521354007:0":{"text":"お父さん……！","source_cn":"阿爹——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1E292E441E318E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521354008:0":{"text":"ふん……","source_cn":"哼……<key:dialog9>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3DB48CF10BD9B99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521354009:0":{"text":"お前、名をマルコと言ったな？","source_cn":"你叫马尔科，是吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87914D146DD16EA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521354010:0":{"text":"はい……","source_cn":"对……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E2B22E29E3F8BCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521354011:1":{"text":"その意志の強さ、感心したよ……フルアを連れて樹怒の谷を出て、どこか別の場所で生きていけ。","source_cn":"你的意志力还算可以。看在芙的份上……你带着她离开树怒山...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CCD24A43340B994","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521354012:0":{"text":"お父さん……それって……私たちのことを認めてくれるの？","source_cn":"阿……阿爹？你……你同意了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B8E9C388EBDDA44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521354013:0":{"text":"完全に認めたとは言ってない！俺はホーリンに対する憎しみまで捨てるつもりはない。","source_cn":"没有完全同意！我不会为了他放下雅库伯尔和呼临人之间的仇恨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD03707E715BF5543","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521354014:0":{"text":"でもな……お前は俺の娘だ。子どもの幸せを望まない親がどこにいる？","source_cn":"但是芙……你是我的孩子。我希望你开心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x233857D1A457A367","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521354015:0":{"text":"だから樹怒の谷を離れて、他の場所で暮らしなさい。そうすれば、誰もお前たちのことを邪魔しないだろう。","source_cn":"所以离开树怒山谷，去其他地方生活。那样就不会有人阻拦你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FB4F960A3C94401","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521354016:1":{"text":"フルアに優しくしろよ。さもないと、次はこの程度じゃ済まないぞ！","source_cn":"对芙好一点，否则我就扒了你的皮！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF5CB83C68C46A49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521354017:0":{"text":"ありがとう……お父さん……","source_cn":"谢谢你……阿爹……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFE408DE910502EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521354018:0":{"text":"ありがとうございます……","source_cn":"谢谢……<key:dialog52>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD971F6AC3B2E4F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:颚":{"text":"ジャル","source":"颚","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:马尔科":{"text":"マルコ","source":"马尔科","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:芙":{"text":"フルア","source":"芙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":3}}